* Identify interactive elements (modals, drawers, tooltips, tabs, accordions, carousels, sliders, pagination, command palette via `cmdk`).
* Identify API/data dependencies: Supabase REST tables, Edge Functions, real-time subscriptions.
* Identify authentication/session behavior (Supabase Auth, 2FA, role selection, profile readiness).
* Identify external integrations (Sentry, OpenTelemetry, telemedicine, voice notes, AI demo).
* Identify important business-critical user journeys (see §5).
* Identify pages that require different responsive layouts (kiosk, mobile consultation, patient portal, dashboard variants).
* Identify dynamically loaded content (lazy routes, virtualized lists via `@tanstack/react-virtual`).
* Identify loading, empty, error, success, and disabled states.

