Use this sequence:

### Phase 1 — Smoke Test

Verify:

* Application starts (`npm run dev` / `npx vite --port 8080` boots without errors).
* Homepage loads (`/` → `/hospital`).
* Major routes load (login, dashboard, patients, appointments).
* No critical console errors (JS errors, unhandled rejections, failed network requests).
* Primary CTA works (login CTA, "Register Patient", "New Appointment").
* Authentication works (login → dashboard for all 7 roles).

